# An allowlist: everything stays out of the .vsix except what runs and what
# the Marketplace and the licenses ask for. A new file in the repository is
# therefore left out until it is named here. `pnpm exec vsce ls
# --no-dependencies` shows what would be shipped.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES
!assets/package/icon.png
!out/extension.cjs
!out/webview/webview.js
!out/webview/webview.css
